<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  IP-XACT (IEEE 1685-2014) component for TLUCToAXI4 (TileLink -> AXI bridge).
  Tapeout-readiness program T7 (DESIGN_READINESS.md) packaging deliverable, adopted from
  the shared sign-off kit (pathfound on IP-axi-to-2apbs). The DUT is Chisel: ports are
  generated verbatim from the elaborated SV (generated/uc/TLUCToAXI4.sv), which is git-ignored and regenerated by
  `make elab` — so this committed component is the contract and `make pkg`
  (pkg/check_ipxact.sh) re-checks the model ports against freshly-elaborated SV (fails on
  drift). The TileLink and AXI channels are grouped as bus interfaces by their io_ prefix
  (logical name = the physical suffix); clock references the AMBA clock def by VLNV.
-->
